From 4d6e801258d55e8f3fccd32a5b5a8b7ff1982cdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 08:41:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 129/134] fix(pypto-x): count the per-dtype pack module apart
 from shape kernels (W8J J1.1)

The J1.1 bridge needs one native pack module per dtype to pre-pack weights
before any shape kernel exists. Build it through the same disk tier but keep
kernel_builds/compile_calls/disk_hits meaning "one per (dtype, M, K, N)" by
counting the pack module under pack_module_* keys.

The bf16 tile payload also interleaves k pairs for _mm512_dpbf16_ps; document
the exact layout and fix the test reference accordingly. Self-heal tests now
accept that the shared per-variant .so may be repaired by the pack module load
first.
